# Never ship build junk, local state, or SECRETS into an image.
# .env is the important one: provider keys live there and must NEVER be baked into a layer —
# Fly injects them as runtime secrets instead (fly secrets set). An image can be pulled/inspected.
.env
.env.*
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
web/dist
.git
.gitignore
runs
reports
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
